24,0:02:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! That's a huge sea king!Dialogue: 5,0:02:46.09,0:02:48.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it fighting?Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.10,0:02:59.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's dead! It got killed!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:05.46,Title,,0,0,0,,CheerDialogue: 1,0:02:59.83,0:03:05.46,Title,,0,0,0,,CheerDialogue: 5,0:03:00.60,0:03:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,– But it's huge! – I couldn't see what did it!Dialogue: 5,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's scary around here.Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.27,0:03:13.61,Main,,0,0,0,,– A man? – Hey! Who are you?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:16.34,0:03:17.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh boy...Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.61,0:03:19.58,Main,,0,0,0,,D...Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.71,0:03:22.81,Main,,0,0,0,,D...Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.81,0:03:26.39,Main,,0,0,0,,– Dark King Rayleigh!! – What?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys.  We met at Sabaody Archipelago.Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.00,0:03:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,He was the first mate of Roger, the king of the pirates!Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.29,0:03:44.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, my ship sank in the storm and I had no choice but to swim.Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.60,0:03:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Storm?! The Calm Belt is always calm  - it's never rough!Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.60,0:03:50.78,Main,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be a storm!Dialogue: 5,0:03:50.78,0:03:55.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That means his ship wrecked further away and he swam all the way here?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a good breaststroke.Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.69,0:04:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not the point.Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.05,0:04:03.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, that sea king was fighting with...Dialogue: 5,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.24,Main,,0,0,0,,you?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:05.24,0:04:09.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Only a legendary pirate could do that!Dialogue: 5,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you sorry for?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.67,0:04:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:04:18.50,0:04:21.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I assume Luffy-kun must be here on this island.Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hearDialogue: 5,0:04:28.59,0:04:30.29,Main,,0,0,8,,that the Snake Princess and the others...Dialogue: 5,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.82,Main,,0,0,8,,have just gone to deliver food to Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.82,0:04:35.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna stretch his body again!Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.64,0:04:39.39,Main,,0,0,0,,They said they'll invite him over when he gets better.Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.39,0:04:41.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!Dialogue: 5,0:04:41.45,0:04:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see him again this soon!Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.59,0:04:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe I'll make clothes for him again...Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.03,0:04:49.97,Main,,0,0,0,,without frills!Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.35,0:04:59.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We're separated although we're newlyweds!Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like a tragic heroine!Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,"But Hancock... No, my dear wife!"Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.29,0:05:07.67,Main,,0,0,0,,"Y-Yes!"Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.67,0:05:11.69,Main,,0,0,0,,"No matter how far away from each other  we are, our love is forever!"Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.69,0:05:14.06,Main,,0,0,0,,"Luffy!"Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.06,0:05:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my sweet husband!  My heart is aflame!Dialogue: 5,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, Snake Princess,Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.99,0:05:27.14,Main,,0,0,0,,just because someone hugs you and uses your name,Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.14,0:05:28.84,Main,,0,0,0,,it doesn't mean you are married.Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.84,0:05:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, what counts as marriage?Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.78,0:05:34.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmmm... That's a difficult question.Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.94,0:05:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't go to Sabaody now with that wound.Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.22,0:05:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But I wanna see my friends  as soon as possible.Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.10,0:05:48.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to be there just like I promised.Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.10,0:05:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm? The submarine is gone.Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.30,0:05:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy-kun !Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! The Old Man Rayleigh!Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you this soon!Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.54,0:06:05.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.89,0:06:10.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I was about to head to Sabaody using the vivre card.Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.15,0:06:13.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you see my friends?Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.39,0:06:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think they made it there yet.Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.35,0:06:21.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I gave my vivre card to Shakky...Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.09,0:06:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,in order to go anywhere I want.Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.50,0:06:31.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh! Is it really you?  I can't believe it!Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be the former warlord...Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.82,0:06:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.79,0:06:39.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't expect to see a living legend here.Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.20,0:06:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Here. Isn't this hat important to you?Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It is. Thanks.Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.05,0:06:53.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel right without it after all!Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.61,0:06:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a group of pirates here?Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.70,0:07:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about Trafalgar Law, he just left.Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.84,0:07:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,He said that you have to rest in bed for 2 more weeks.Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.14,0:07:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He saved your life, didn't he?Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.65,0:07:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What a waste! We got that far...Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.60,0:07:24.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get in the female-only empire.Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.90,0:07:26.81,Main,,0,0,0,,They were allowing bears in.Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.13,0:07:29.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,So weak!Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.20,0:07:34.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the Dark King is up to.Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.10,0:07:37.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I'm sure that "D." will  cause quite a storm once again...Dialogue: 5,0:07:38.30,0:07:40.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Can't wait to see him again.Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.70,0:07:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Rayleigh?! You must be Rayleigh!Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.90,0:07:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gloriosa! It's been awhile!Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.02,0:07:52.49,Main,,0,0,0,,– Rayleigh! – Ray-san !Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.49,0:07:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you two are here too!Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.86,0:07:56.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.30,0:08:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Sis! How could you ignore the man who saved your life?Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.56,0:08:04.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You know the Old Man Rayleigh?Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.20,0:08:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yes! – It's a long story.Dialogue: 5,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, so you're awake now.Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.41,0:08:12.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't slept for days worrying about you.Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.10,0:08:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.  I brought some food.Dialogue: 5,0:08:15.70,0:08:17.84,Main,,0,0,0,,So go ahead and dig in...Dialogue: 5,0:08:17.84,0:08:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't even look at him.Dialogue: 5,0:08:19.90,0:08:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you call it marriage?Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.71,0:08:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Serve him...Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.09,0:08:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Serve him a meal already!Dialogue: 5,0:08:30.12,0:08:34.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! These are not for you!Dialogue: 5,0:08:35.01,0:08:36.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You can have just a little bit.Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.41,0:08:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay. Luffy-kun,  why don't we just eat?Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.83,0:08:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun, you have to eat. Eating is living!Dialogue: 5,0:09:03.60,0:09:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it! That's my Luffy-kun !Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.09,0:09:13.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me the letter from Shakky.Dialogue: 5,0:09:14.63,0:09:17.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds like she hasn't changed.Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.60,0:09:21.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's just the way she was when you were living in Sabaody.Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.89,0:09:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,She's doing fine.Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.88,0:09:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,These girls have become very beautiful and strong over the past 13 years.Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.80,0:09:34.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, Shakky, Elder Nyon.Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.09,0:09:39.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You three protected us when we were running from the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But we have a problem.Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.79,0:09:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We should be providing shelter for Luffy from the Navy.Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.69,0:09:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though Rayleigh knows Luffy from before,Dialogue: 5,0:09:50.29,0:09:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,if it's easy enough for someone to guess that Luffy's here,Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.11,Main,,0,0,0,,we should be worrying.Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.11,0:09:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What an old familiar face!Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Rayleigh, aren't you?Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You just noticed?! How mad are you about him?!Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think the Navy can guess that he's here.Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.69,0:10:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all, the one who sent him awayDialogue: 5,0:10:14.24,0:10:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,told me that he sent him in this direction.Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.70,0:10:21.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I work for the Revolutionary Army.Dialogue: 5,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.47,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Since I have a connection with them.Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I wanna let them get away from here.Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.37,0:10:28.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't believe it.Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.79,0:10:32.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And where's Monkey-chan now?Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.50,0:10:35.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about my abrupt manner earlier.Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.86,0:10:44.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Can I talk to you for a moment?Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.09,0:10:46.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't have...Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.81,0:10:49.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,much time left.Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat should be...Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.70,0:10:58.10,Main,,0,0,0,,In the direction that Bartholomew Kuma blew Luffy-kun away,Dialogue: 5,0:10:58.10,0:11:01.01,Main,,0,0,0,,there is the Isle of Women.Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.01,0:11:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,When I thought about how Luffy-kun  was able to infiltrate the great prison,Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,it dawned on me that Luffy-kunDialogue: 5,0:11:08.28,0:11:13.15,Main,,0,0,0,,must have stowed away on  a Navy ship with Hancock, but...Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.99,0:11:20.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Since Hancock hates both the government and men,Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.63,0:11:23.93,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I don't think that she'd get on a government ship,Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.64,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,especially not to help a man.Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Now, this part is all theoretical.Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.77,0:11:31.70,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But how about this?Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.39,0:11:38.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Say that Hancock fell in love with Monkey-chan,Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.10,0:11:39.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,everything makes sense.Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Monkey-chan is a good-looking guy.Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And if I were Hancock,Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.41,0:11:53.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'd give him refuge on  the Isle of Women to spite the Navy.Dialogue: 5,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's a very subjective theory, Shakky.Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.01,0:12:04.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Women's intuition is unbelievable.Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my Shakky!Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.27,0:12:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,She couldn't be any more right, as you can see.Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.81,0:12:12.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah? You like it? Good!Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.90,0:12:17.86,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy won't take action based on a ridiculous theory like that.Dialogue: 5,0:12:18.60,0:12:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,So this place is safe.Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get down to business.Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.99,0:12:25.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun.Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.16,0:12:32.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you're gonna head for Sabaody, didn't you?Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.20,0:12:37.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to see my friends.Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that what you really want?Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.81,0:12:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabaody Archipelago.Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.10,0:12:52.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what happened  to you guys on that island?Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.33,0:13:04.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Everyone focus on escaping!Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.46,0:13:10.17,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As we are now, we can't beat these guys!Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.20,0:13:18.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I couldn't save even one of my friends...!Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.72,0:13:35.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can face those tremendous powers as you are now?Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.14,0:13:53.85,Main,,0,0,0,,But I...Dialogue: 5,0:13:53.85,0:13:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be reunited with your  friends just to endure the same fate?Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.85,0:14:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a suggestion for you.Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.75,0:14:05.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's up to you to...Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,do it or not.Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.60,0:14:22.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, on the Bowin Archipelago  in the Grand Line...Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.94,0:14:25.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop! Usoppun!Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.91,0:14:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't stop me, Heraclesun!Dialogue: 5,0:14:28.33,0:14:30.72,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Usopp is...Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.72,0:14:33.89,Narrator,,0,0,0,,shaking his body which has grown hugeDialogue: 5,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.49,Narrator,,0,0,0,,from eating an abundant  variety of food in the forest...Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and running.Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.10,0:14:45.03,Main,,0,0,0,,It's impossibleun!Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.03,0:14:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's not! That's why I'll try again!Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I can do it this time!Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.33,0:14:55.41,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are!Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.54,0:15:02.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.99,0:15:04.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Lethal..Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.28,0:15:10.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh noun! Usoppun!Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.50,0:15:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Usoppun?Dialogue: 5,0:15:18.78,0:15:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.09,0:15:24.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.  If you try to get off of this island,Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.04,0:15:27.81,Main,,0,0,0,,terrifying living things will stand in your wayDialogue: 5,0:15:27.81,0:15:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,and push you back to the forestun.Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.39,0:15:41.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing will stop you from entering the islandunDialogue: 5,0:15:42.60,0:15:45.20,Main,,0,0,0,,but once you've set foot on it, you're dead!Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,No one ever leaves this island aliveun!Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.43,0:15:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,And my name is Heraclesun!Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.41,0:15:55.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?! Usoppun! Where did you go?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:01.67,0:16:03.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's in dangerun!Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.11,0:16:06.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea creature has just come onto the island!Dialogue: 5,0:16:06.05,0:16:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Usoppun is in danger!Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.50,0:16:17.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The sweet scent from Bowin Archipelago draws the attention of...Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.21,0:16:20.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,giant insects and giant birds...Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.63,0:16:23.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and even sea creatures and sea kings.Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.89,0:16:25.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a sea hippo!Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.41,0:16:31.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't get fascinated by it now!Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.50,0:16:35.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The scents lure them deeper into the island...Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.35,0:16:38.94,Main,,0,0,0,,where they find the forest filled with food.Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.69,0:16:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's easy to enter the island...Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.78,0:16:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's hard to leave...Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.89,0:16:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Outta my way!Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Lethal Exploding Star!Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.60,0:17:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get out of here!Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.87,0:17:05.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.70,0:17:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Usoppun!Dialogue: 5,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.81,Main,,0,0,0,,The islands are gonna move again!Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.81,0:17:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.15,0:17:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Usoppun! Hang onto a tree!Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.39,0:17:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's happening again?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.82,0:17:23.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna eat something!Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.70,0:17:33.36,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The name of this flower that looks like an island is...Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.70,Narrator,,0,0,0,,People call them the Bowin ArchipelagoDialogue: 5,0:17:47.70,0:17:51.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,but the scientific name is  stomach baron: a meat-eating plant!Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.21,0:17:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Usoppun!Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you, Usoppun?Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.97,0:18:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You changed since reading the newspaper that news coo brought!Dialogue: 5,0:18:17.01,0:18:18.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.04,0:18:26.18,Main,,0,0,0,,have no time to waste here now!Dialogue: 5,0:18:29.62,0:18:35.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy lost his brother in the war!Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.43,0:18:41.03,Main,,0,0,0,,He must be having a very hard time now!Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.41,0:19:02.32,Main,,0,0,0,,When your friend is having a hard time,Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.32,0:19:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,you should be there for him!Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.23,0:19:12.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!!Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.07,0:19:20.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You go now, Mister Tanuki?Dialogue: 5,0:19:20.27,0:19:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We just became friends!Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.91,0:19:29.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I read in the newspaper that my friend is in trouble.Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.60,0:19:32.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to go back as soon as I can.Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.01,0:19:35.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I met Luffy's brother in Arabasta.Dialogue: 5,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,How could such a terrible thing happen?Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.55,0:19:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to meet up with Luffy,  and treat his injuries!Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.71,0:19:45.60,Main,,0,0,0,,He'll definitely do something crazy over this.Dialogue: 5,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Mister Tanuki...Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.75,0:19:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you were able to  make peace with the birds.Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.80,0:19:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to Mister Tanuki  risking life to persuade birds!Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me.Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.48,0:20:01.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, try to be nice to the humans too!Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.31,0:20:08.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The people here only need some  of the plants growing on that tree.Dialogue: 5,0:20:08.02,0:20:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right!Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.30,0:20:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We not attack egg. Not do any harm.Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.04,0:20:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We not same as people who force you from homeland!Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.93,0:20:25.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, the effects of the medicinal plants harvested from this tree work so fast.Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.20,0:20:26.92,Main,,0,0,0,,My wounds are healing already.Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.92,0:20:32.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're the treasured recipes of our ancestors!Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.60,0:20:38.89,Main,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I kind of want to stay on this island and research these herbs.Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.89,0:20:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,They must contain some components that I don't know about.Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,But there's no time...Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Come other time!Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.46,0:20:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We give you big welcome!Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? You'd do that for me?Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.08,0:20:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,After I meet up with my friends, I'll definitely tell them about this place!Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.94,0:21:03.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I'll come and see you all again!Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.68,0:21:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Here. You'll get hungry on long trip.Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.74,0:21:09.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.24,0:21:11.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Come again, Mister Tanuki!Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's cotton candy!Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.96,0:21:19.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright everyone, try and get along!Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.63,0:21:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Mister Tanuki!Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.49,0:21:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, I've got my lunch and my cotton candy.Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.79,0:21:29.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Time to meet up with Luffy and the others!Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have a pirate ship!Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.88,0:21:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.04,0:21:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, we're high! And moving fast!Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.50,0:21:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up to everyone else in no time!Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.90,0:21:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, news coo! Can I have a newspaper?Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.60,0:21:51.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll read the newspaper while I eat my lunch.Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.78,0:21:55.69,Main,,0,0,0,,The news from the war is probably becoming clear by now.Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.41,0:22:02.10,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.47,0:22:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:06.20,0:22:09.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is Luffy once again...Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.49,0:22:14.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is Gloom Island on the Grand Line,Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.60,0:22:17.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,the remnants of the Muggy Kingdom.Dialogue: 5,0:22:17.40,0:22:20.67,Narrator,,0,0,0,,An old castle still stands in this ruined land.Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.67,0:22:26.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A certain man happens to have made this his home for the last few years.Dialogue: 5,0:22:26.16,0:22:29.49,Main,,0,0,0,,How could Moria-sama die in the war?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.59,0:22:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You are irritating. If you must cry, go outside.Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.14,0:22:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What a cold-hearted man! How can you say that to someone in mourning?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:47.47,0:22:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Why can't you say something nice to cheer me up, and bring me a warm cup of cocoa?Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.02,0:22:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm your guest, you know!Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.36,0:22:55.89,Main,,0,0,0,,An uninvited guest.Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.89,0:22:59.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You just barged in and settled here during my absence.Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.68,0:23:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides...Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.79,0:23:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,This article is not entirely credible.Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.89,0:23:08.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Does that mean that Moria-sama wasn't killed in the war?Dialogue: 5,0:23:08.80,0:23:12.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I am not certain whether he still lives...Dialogue: 5,0:23:12.09,0:23:14.91,Main,,0,0,0,,but, from what I recall,Dialogue: 5,0:23:14.91,0:23:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Moria was still alive when I last saw him on the battlefield.Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.49,0:23:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,If he didn't die in battle, why would they print an article like that?Dialogue: 5,0:23:27.49,0:23:28.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oni...Dialogue: 5,0:23:29.76,0:23:30.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Giri!Dialogue: 5,0:23:39.59,0:23:41.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think saliva will heal it?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.49,0:23:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you pick up a folk remedy like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.19,0:23:51.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn these guys... How long are they gonna keep mocking me?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:52.40,0:23:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll never make it to the ocean!Dialogue: 5,0:24:04.59,0:24:05.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Eye...Dialogue: 5,0:24:07.00,0:24:09.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been some time since you left the castle.Dialogue: 5,0:24:09.39,0:24:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yet you're still in here, Roronoa?Dialogue: 5,0:24:12.46,0:24:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It appears that the rowboat I lent you is now useless.Dialogue: 5,0:24:17.30,0:24:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I can still use it like a piece of driftwood,Dialogue: 5,0:24:21.53,0:24:23.64,Main,,0,0,0,,and swim while holding onto it!Dialogue: 5,0:24:24.30,0:24:26.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's admirable to worry about your crewmates...Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.48,0:24:28.34,Main,,0,0,0,,but these beasts shouldn't be underestimated.Dialogue: 5,0:24:29.16,0:24:33.99,Main,,0,0,0,,They're called humandrills. Clever baboons who learn by imitating humans.Dialogue: 5,0:24:33.99,0:24:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Humandrills?Dialogue: 5,0:24:35.99,0:24:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's said that if they live with peaceful humans, they become peaceful themselves.Dialogue: 5,0:24:40.79,0:24:42.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But this land...Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.90,0:24:48.11,Main,,0,0,0,,was ravaged by a brutal war seven years ago.Dialogue: 5,0:24:49.00,0:24:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,When I made this island my home, the smell of blood and smoke was still in the air.Dialogue: 5,0:24:54.40,0:24:57.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There were so many corpses scattered around, you couldn't even walk.Dialogue: 5,0:24:58.01,0:25:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, these guys grew up watching those ferocious humans.Dialogue: 5,0:25:03.30,0:25:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,They're baboons who learned to use human weapons, and became warriors of the forest.Dialogue: 5,0:25:08.79,0:25:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Mankind rules over the animals with weapons and intelligence.Dialogue: 5,0:25:12.92,0:25:15.85,Main,,0,0,0,,However, animals become frighteningly strong if they learn to use weapons.Dialogue: 5,0:25:16.71,0:25:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Fitting opponents, perhaps, for an overconfident youth.Dialogue: 5,0:25:20.39,0:25:21.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You talking about me?Dialogue: 5,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Who else is here?Dialogue: 5,0:25:24.30,0:25:26.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's late. Come to the castle.Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.80,0:25:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The beasts won't approach my castle.Dialogue: 5,0:25:30.40,0:25:33.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't give me orders!Dialogue: 5,0:25:33.69,0:25:35.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going out to sea, right now!Dialogue: 5,0:25:36.80,0:25:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that so?Dialogue: 5,0:25:39.30,0:25:40.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.Dialogue: 5,0:25:43.01,0:25:45.89,Main,,0,0,0,,So what if they're warriors of the forest or whatever...Dialogue: 5,0:25:45.89,0:25:49.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to lounge around!Dialogue: 5,0:25:58.20,0:26:01.71,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in a country that researches weather...Dialogue: 5,0:26:01.71,0:26:05.28,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The small sky island Weatheria.Dialogue: 5,0:26:10.40,0:26:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here! I'll return everything I stole!Dialogue: 5,0:26:15.39,0:26:16.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Haredas-san !Dialogue: 5,0:26:16.90,0:26:18.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone call Haredas-san !Dialogue: 5,0:26:18.49,0:26:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!Dialogue: 5,0:26:21.60,0:26:25.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you out! There's no telling what you'll do!Dialogue: 5,0:26:25.94,0:26:29.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do to teach her a lesson?Dialogue: 5,0:26:29.23,0:26:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Should we punish her by flooding her cage, or striking it with lighting?Dialogue: 5,0:26:32.49,0:26:34.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn cat burglar!Dialogue: 5,0:26:35.90,0:26:38.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything...Dialogue: 5,0:26:38.68,0:26:41.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, just let me out!Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.09,0:26:42.94,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 5,0:26:44.10,0:26:45.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:45.40,0:26:46.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:46.44,0:26:47.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:47.80,0:26:49.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Haredas!Dialogue: 5,0:26:49.52,0:26:51.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:51.99,0:26:53.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:53.29,0:26:54.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:54.71,0:26:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:56.29,0:26:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:57.36,0:26:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 5,0:26:58.50,0:26:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Girl!Dialogue: 5,0:26:59.91,0:27:01.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop that.Dialogue: 5,0:27:01.10,0:27:04.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I hear you were running wild all over the place...Dialogue: 5,0:27:06.04,0:27:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!Dialogue: 5,0:27:07.27,0:27:08.99,Main,,0,0,0,,The perfect thing at this time!Dialogue: 5,0:27:08.99,0:27:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, have a look...Dialogue: 5,0:27:10.71,0:27:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,at these firmly tied "knots of wind"!Dialogue: 5,0:27:17.72,0:27:20.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Mr. Haredas!Dialogue: 5,0:27:23.00,0:27:24.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to help me!Dialogue: 5,0:27:24.93,0:27:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll punch you again if I have to! I'm in a hurry!Dialogue: 5,0:27:27.63,0:27:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Mr. Haredas! Please respond, Mr. Haredas!Dialogue: 5,0:27:33.10,0:27:36.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey... This is... Haredas here...Dialogue: 5,0:27:37.12,0:27:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,She attacked him without warning! What a demon!Dialogue: 5,0:27:40.41,0:27:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Someone call a doctor!Dialogue: 5,0:27:42.71,0:27:44.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Grrr!Dialogue: 5,0:27:47.30,0:27:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:27:49.00,0:27:53.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Not only did she steal weather balls from the weather-field, but our research notes as well?Dialogue: 5,0:27:53.92,0:27:56.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It is as you see, Mr. Haredas.Dialogue: 5,0:27:57.50,0:27:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Girl.Dialogue: 5,0:27:59.50,0:28:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I used to be a thief, and now I'm a pirate.Dialogue: 5,0:28:04.69,0:28:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me stealing stuff?Dialogue: 5,0:28:06.46,0:28:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,She's pure evil! How can she even call herself human?!Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.80,0:28:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What a villainess we've let into our country!Dialogue: 5,0:28:14.75,0:28:16.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said...Dialogue: 5,0:28:16.84,0:28:19.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get out of this country!Dialogue: 5,0:28:19.78,0:28:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Just let me out of here already, I'm begging you!Dialogue: 5,0:28:22.95,0:28:26.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry! I gave back everything I stole, didn't I?Dialogue: 5,0:28:26.74,0:28:28.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me out!Dialogue: 5,0:28:28.59,0:28:32.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay back! She's vile!Dialogue: 5,0:28:35.81,0:28:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you all of a sudden?Dialogue: 5,0:28:38.90,0:28:43.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard you tried to steal a balloon to go down to the surface...Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.65,0:28:47.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Amateurs can't use those. You could have died!Dialogue: 5,0:28:49.84,0:28:52.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the newspaper.Dialogue: 5,0:28:52.51,0:28:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The newspaper?Dialogue: 5,0:28:55.75,0:28:58.91,Main,,0,0,0,,The Luffy that the newspaper is talking about...Dialogue: 5,0:28:58.91,0:29:00.45,Main,,0,0,0,,He's my captain.Dialogue: 5,0:29:00.45,0:29:01.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 5,0:29:02.89,0:29:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? This kid?Dialogue: 5,0:29:04.82,0:29:09.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The one who wreaked havoc on the battlefield during the recent war...Dialogue: 5,0:29:09.14,0:29:11.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The infamous straw-hat rookie...Dialogue: 5,0:29:11.43,0:29:15.19,Main,,0,0,0,,While his crewmates were scattered all around the world...Dialogue: 5,0:29:15.19,0:29:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy has been fighting a terrible battle all on his own.Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.91,0:29:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,He stormed into that great war to save Ace...Dialogue: 5,0:29:33.65,0:29:36.90,Main,,0,0,0,,but he lost Ace right before his eyes...Dialogue: 5,0:29:36.90,0:29:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,and I had no idea any of this was happening!Dialogue: 5,0:29:42.20,0:29:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy will definitely come... to our meeting place.Dialogue: 5,0:29:49.37,0:29:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Before his heart shatters completely...Dialogue: 5,0:29:55.40,0:29:59.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to find him and help him!Dialogue: 5,0:30:05.28,0:30:07.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! Girl!Dialogue: 5,0:30:07.69,0:30:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and let her out!Dialogue: 5,0:30:09.58,0:30:12.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We locked up a young girl and made her cry...Dialogue: 5,0:30:12.69,0:30:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,How could we be so cruel?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:14.73,0:30:16.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Give Mr. Haredas the key!Dialogue: 5,0:30:16.19,0:30:17.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, the key!Dialogue: 5,0:30:17.59,0:30:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,There. Now come on out.Dialogue: 5,0:30:19.60,0:30:21.07,Main,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry, girl...Dialogue: 5,0:30:27.34,0:30:28.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did the girl go?Dialogue: 5,0:30:28.90,0:30:30.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Mr. Haredas is gone too.Dialogue: 5,0:30:37.21,0:30:39.75,Main,,0,0,0,,When'd she get over there?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:41.52,0:30:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:30:43.12,0:30:44.22,Main,,0,0,0,,So long!Dialogue: 5,0:30:44.22,0:30:46.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What?!Dialogue: 5,0:30:46.64,0:30:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,She was faking her tears and took Mr. Haredas hostage!Dialogue: 5,0:30:49.74,0:30:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,She took all the stolen goods too!Dialogue: 5,0:30:52.40,0:30:56.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The weather science of Weatheria must never be revealed to the world!Dialogue: 5,0:30:56.57,0:30:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,After her!Dialogue: 5,0:30:58.29,0:31:01.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Anywhere will do. Just please, take me down to the ground!Dialogue: 5,0:31:01.95,0:31:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's crazy...Dialogue: 5,0:31:03.04,0:31:04.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know it is!Dialogue: 5,0:31:06.10,0:31:08.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy... Are you alright?Dialogue: 5,0:31:08.90,0:31:13.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... You were always helping us...Dialogue: 5,0:31:13.34,0:31:16.95,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And now, when it's our turn to help you...Dialogue: 5,0:31:16.95,0:31:20.06,Main,,0,0,0,,After her! Don't let her get away!Dialogue: 5,0:31:21.79,0:31:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Girl, your fake tears are back...Dialogue: 5,0:31:27.63,0:31:28.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut it!Dialogue: 5,0:31:33.20,0:31:36.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the land where the genius Vegapunk was born...Dialogue: 5,0:31:36.90,0:31:40.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Futureland of Baldimore, on a winter island...Dialogue: 5,0:31:43.08,0:31:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Intruder alert!Dialogue: 5,0:31:45.28,0:31:48.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone has broken into Doctor Vegapunk's lab!Dialogue: 5,0:31:50.25,0:31:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fire your guns inside the lab!Dialogue: 5,0:31:52.59,0:31:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Treat every single object in there like a world treasure!Dialogue: 5,0:31:55.96,0:31:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood?!Dialogue: 5,0:31:57.00,0:31:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood!Dialogue: 5,0:32:00.03,0:32:01.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 5,0:32:01.70,0:32:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! The Navy is here too?Dialogue: 5,0:32:08.29,0:32:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I can't!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.24,0:32:12.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I mustn't shoot in here!Dialogue: 5,0:32:13.51,0:32:16.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Treasure? That laboratory?Dialogue: 5,0:32:16.91,0:32:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. Vegapunk is the active leader of all the scientists in the Navy.Dialogue: 5,0:32:23.35,0:32:25.49,Main,,0,0,0,,He is the pride of our country.Dialogue: 5,0:32:25.49,0:32:29.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Rather, his brain can be considered one of mankind's greatest assets.Dialogue: 5,0:32:29.96,0:32:34.16,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a place of memories for Vegapunk. He spent his childhood days here.Dialogue: 5,0:32:36.83,0:32:38.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a look at that mountain.Dialogue: 5,0:32:39.10,0:32:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,It has an odd shape, right?Dialogue: 5,0:32:41.14,0:32:42.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now that you mention it...Dialogue: 5,0:32:42.81,0:32:45.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?Dialogue: 5,0:32:45.09,0:32:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,It's something he created as a child,Dialogue: 5,0:32:47.52,0:32:51.51,Main,,0,0,0,,thinking about the citizens who must endure this intense cold.Dialogue: 5,0:32:52.20,0:32:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,He rebuilt the animals of the forest to help work on it, and got this far, but it remains incomplete.Dialogue: 5,0:32:59.82,0:33:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a ground-heating system, intended to warm the entire island.Dialogue: 5,0:33:05.33,0:33:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,But he always had the same problem...Dialogue: 5,0:33:09.49,0:33:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,He could never fully realize the ideas he had in his head.Dialogue: 5,0:33:14.24,0:33:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,He lacked the resources and funding to make them a reality.Dialogue: 5,0:33:18.84,0:33:22.78,Main,,0,0,0,,But the sight of him crying when he was unable to help us...Dialogue: 5,0:33:22.78,0:33:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,was enough to warm our hearts.Dialogue: 5,0:33:30.89,0:33:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What a super tear-jerking story!Dialogue: 5,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You think so?Dialogue: 5,0:33:36.22,0:33:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,We are still waiting for him to come home.Dialogue: 5,0:33:42.81,0:33:48.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that you know, please never go back to that laboratory with its...Dialogue: 5,0:33:48.40,0:33:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,self-destruct button.Dialogue: 5,0:33:49.67,0:33:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Did you just casually mention the most unnecessary button in the entire world?Dialogue: 5,0:33:57.00,0:33:59.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was a button like that...Dialogue: 5,0:33:59.28,0:34:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, let's just go back home and we'll drink some warm tea!Dialogue: 5,0:34:04.10,0:34:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!Dialogue: 5,0:34:05.92,0:34:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The only place I can find an ice breaker to get off this island... is the laboratory, right?Dialogue: 5,0:34:13.70,0:34:16.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I have my own problems to take care of.Dialogue: 5,0:34:16.72,0:34:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I just read the news that my captain has been through hell, you see.Dialogue: 5,0:34:22.27,0:34:23.10,Main,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 5,0:34:23.10,0:34:25.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in your debt!Dialogue: 5,0:34:25.92,0:34:30.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Whatever you do, never press the self-destruct button!Dialogue: 5,0:34:30.45,0:34:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd press it, you moron?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:32.45,0:34:34.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Why'd he even install something like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:34:36.59,0:34:40.09,Main,,0,0,0,,This is super impressive.Dialogue: 5,0:34:40.09,0:34:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,These are just the inventions he thought of as a kid?Dialogue: 5,0:34:43.30,0:34:47.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The blueprints scattered around here are so advanced, they can't be realized for two or three hundred years.Dialogue: 5,0:34:48.25,0:34:52.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed, as an engineer myself, I don't want people to lay one finger on this place.Dialogue: 5,0:34:52.90,0:34:56.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear? Apparently there's an intruder in the lab!Dialogue: 5,0:34:56.24,0:34:58.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? That's awful!Dialogue: 5,0:34:58.69,0:35:03.65,Main,,0,0,0,,They say that every single blueprint in there is invaluable...Dialogue: 5,0:35:03.65,0:35:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember, if anything in the genius Vegapunk's lab is damaged during this pursuit,Dialogue: 5,0:35:08.30,0:35:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,it will be considered a criminal offense!Dialogue: 5,0:35:10.31,0:35:11.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 5,0:35:13.58,0:35:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, a pirate mark!Dialogue: 5,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you just one thing?Dialogue: 5,0:35:38.69,0:35:42.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,If, by some freak chance, I were to press that button...Dialogue: 5,0:35:43.12,0:35:44.23,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Old man?Dialogue: 5,0:35:45.10,0:35:47.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Would it be my fault?Dialogue: 5,0:35:47.49,0:35:49.37,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Obviously!Dialogue: 5,0:35:50.29,0:35:53.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The world refers to this incident as the Future Kingdom's great disaster:Dialogue: 5,0:35:53.90,0:35:56.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,"The Nightmare of Baldimore".Dialogue: 5,0:36:02.50,0:36:06.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Dark Lord Satan-sama !Dialogue: 5,0:36:07.58,0:36:14.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I never would have dreamed that the day would come when we locked up these guys.Dialogue: 5,0:36:14.52,0:36:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but once we heard that tune you composed and played for us...Dialogue: 5,0:36:19.49,0:36:22.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Courage and fighting spirit welled up inside us,Dialogue: 5,0:36:22.39,0:36:25.84,Main,,0,0,0,,and we took up arms and fought back for the first time in our lives!Dialogue: 5,0:36:26.91,0:36:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, we failed immediately and you had to finish them off...Dialogue: 5,0:36:32.96,0:36:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,but because of you, all the kidnapped villagers are safe again.Dialogue: 5,0:36:39.34,0:36:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me, I just helped out a little.Dialogue: 5,0:36:43.48,0:36:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither gods nor devils will help those who lack the will to fight.Dialogue: 5,0:36:47.70,0:36:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,These are dark times. Even though this really wasn't my business,Dialogue: 5,0:36:51.71,0:36:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make sure that you would stand against the evil that might befall you.Dialogue: 5,0:36:55.66,0:36:57.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How merciful!Dialogue: 5,0:36:57.39,0:37:00.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel as if we could change now!Dialogue: 5,0:37:00.99,0:37:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Satan-sama !Dialogue: 5,0:37:04.90,0:37:07.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That should repay my debt, shouldn't it?Dialogue: 5,0:37:07.74,0:37:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Now then... There was that unbelievable article...Dialogue: 5,0:37:12.08,0:37:15.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, you are alright, are you not?Dialogue: 5,0:37:15.10,0:37:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,My heart shares your pain.Dialogue: 5,0:37:17.92,0:37:20.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Though I do not have a heart.Dialogue: 5,0:37:20.24,0:37:23.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, let us sing together!Dialogue: 5,0:37:23.44,0:37:26.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I will go save your heart, right now!Dialogue: 5,0:37:26.72,0:37:30.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I never thought they'd have the devil as a bodyguard!Dialogue: 5,0:37:30.39,0:37:35.70,Main,,0,0,0,,If we managed to bring these unusual people with only one joint in their arm back to our homeland...Dialogue: 5,0:37:35.70,0:37:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,we could have put them on display and made lots of money!Dialogue: 5,0:37:39.24,0:37:41.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, then...Dialogue: 5,0:37:41.14,0:37:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If we put these longarms with two joints in their arm on display, we can make lots of money!Dialogue: 5,0:37:48.08,0:37:50.51,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Please wait just a minute.Dialogue: 5,0:37:50.51,0:37:55.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you will be no better than them!Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.52,0:37:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please listen to me.Dialogue: 5,0:37:59.79,0:38:04.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Let them go?! If we do that, they'll just...Dialogue: 5,0:38:04.63,0:38:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It will be alright. For they have made a pact with the devil.Dialogue: 5,0:38:10.95,0:38:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, gentlemen?Dialogue: 5,0:38:13.57,0:38:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,If you break your promise to me, and cause trouble in this country again...Dialogue: 5,0:38:19.45,0:38:22.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I will...Dialogue: 5,0:38:22.26,0:38:24.43,Main,,0,0,0,,eat your hearts!Dialogue: 5,0:38:26.43,0:38:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We are shamefully grateful that you let us go!Dialogue: 5,0:38:29.40,0:38:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll head right back to our homeland!Dialogue: 5,0:38:31.51,0:38:35.24,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll never come near this country again!Dialogue: 5,0:38:37.96,0:38:39.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Heave, ho!Dialogue: 5,0:38:40.54,0:38:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Whaaaat?!Dialogue: 5,0:38:41.56,0:38:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! What is this?!Dialogue: 5,0:38:43.98,0:38:46.05,Main,,0,0,0,,And off we go!Dialogue: 5,0:38:46.05,0:38:48.74,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no way the devil actually exists, you dumbass!Dialogue: 5,0:38:48.74,0:38:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You're strong, but you're helpless once we tie you up!Dialogue: 5,0:38:52.54,0:38:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,When we bring back this rare moving skeleton...Dialogue: 5,0:38:55.95,0:38:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be trillionaires!Dialogue: 5,0:38:58.13,0:39:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a second! I have somewhere I must return to!Dialogue: 5,0:39:02.34,0:39:04.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Satan-sama !Dialogue: 5,0:39:04.39,0:39:08.35,Main,,0,0,0,,This is awful! Satan-sama has been kidnapped!Dialogue: 5,0:39:08.35,0:39:12.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Prepare another demonic summoning!Dialogue: 5,0:39:12.74,0:39:17.14,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! We can summon demons now! With panties!Dialogue: 5,0:39:19.76,0:39:23.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san. In difficult times, let us sing together.Dialogue: 5,0:39:23.00,0:39:25.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I am a musician who exists for such occasions.Dialogue: 5,0:39:25.54,0:39:28.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Please wait for me! For I promise...Dialogue: 5,0:39:28.15,0:39:30.24,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I promise I will be there!Dialogue: 5,0:39:30.24,0:39:31.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san...Dialogue: 5,0:39:32.01,0:39:33.25,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy-sa